{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51186","headline":"兀然无事（原卷缺题，不分篇段，现将分爲十一首） 五 · 王梵志","name":"兀然无事（原卷缺题，不分篇段，现将分爲十一首） 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫漫求真佛，真佛不可见。\n妙性及灵台，何曾受薰链。\n心是无事心，面是娘生面。\n劫石可动摇，个中无改变。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51186.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51186","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}